=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8e9e2c3fdefdb0d9aef570c39fa95da, https://si.imgix.net/49fb5048/uploads/origins/a9cd2edb-f527-436b-95b6-1e2a5db6e4ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b7bba1f777e1b84ccf2e06c68dfbd8f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/49fb5048/uploads/origins/a9cd2edb-f527-436b-95b6-1e2a5db6e4ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb9ed42bf11aaa9df7288c98e9fd7c2e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n東方Projectの川代ニトリを描けますか？\n下の画像のような表現でお願いします。また、ニトリはカメラ目線でお願いします。\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/428373281905573888/981680866151505960/unknown.png\n(元画像: https://safebooru.donmai.us/posts/2251006)\n\n彼女の髪留めは、下記の色の順番で3つのビーズを描いていただけますか？\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/428373281905573888/981683265243054090/unknown.png\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/428373281905573888/981680866151505960/unknown.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shiroyamadon/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/16570fc8/uploads/origins/03aeca14-449b-4171-8ccf-f23478529321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5c256184235a8a980bdc0aef08230c49", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16570fc8/uploads/origins/03aeca14-449b-4171-8ccf-f23478529321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5c256184235a8a980bdc0aef08230c49, https://si.imgix.net/16570fc8/uploads/origins/03aeca14-449b-4171-8ccf-f23478529321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cb259531d568d443f526ed2bc038421d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/16570fc8/uploads/origins/03aeca14-449b-4171-8ccf-f234785